Rock - Witness to ancient tales.\nGuru Shikhar - Peak of spiritual heights.\nAchalgarh Mahadev - Ancient fortresses of faith.\nBrahma Kumari Ashram - Sanctuary of spiritual wisdom.\nOvernight stay at Mount Abu hotel.", "start_time": "09:00", "end_time": "18:00", "travel_distance_km": null, "travel_time_minutes": null, "location": "Mount Abu", "hotel_name": null, "room_category": null, "meal_plan": "CP", "breakfast": true, "lunch": false, "dinner": true, "breakfast_hotels": [null, null], "lunch_hotels": [null, null], "dinner_hotels": [null, null], "epai_plan_only": false, "guest_self_booked_hotel": false, "vehicle_type": "AC Car", "pickup_location": null, "drop_location": null, "guide_required": false, "activities": [], "images": [], "internal_notes": "", "client_notes": "", "operations_notes": "", "status": "planned", "completion_pct": 0, "packing_tips": "", "things_to_carry": []}, {"day_uuid": "60179312-d5aa-7362-3b17-bb95710ee987", "day_number": 4, "day_title": "Mount Abu - Ranakpur - Jodhpur", "alternate_day_titles": [], "day_subtitle": null, "day_theme": "Heritage", "day_description": "The \"Blue City\" Jodhpur boasts the majestic fort and a sea of blue houses. Discover its rich history, exciting shopping markets, and scenic views of the Thar Desert.\nAfter breakfast, journey to Jodhpur via Ranakpur Jain Temples, renowned for their majestic architecture. Upon arrival in Jodhpur, check-in at the hotel.\nOvernight stay at your hotel in Jodhpur.", "start_time": "09:00", "end_time": "18:00", "travel_distance_km": null, "travel_time_minutes": null, "location": "Mount Abu", "hotel_name": null, "room_category": null, "meal_plan": "CP", "breakfast": true, "lunch": false, "dinner": true, "breakfast_hotels": [null, null], "lunch_hotels": [null, null], "dinner_hotels": [null, null], "epai_plan_only": false, "guest_self_booked_hotel": false, "vehicle_type": "AC Car", "pickup_location": null, "drop_location": null, "guide_required": false, "activities": [], "images": [], "in